= Coalition Demands

[? if left_wing_coalition : We are in a coalition without demands. ?]

[? if not psi_in_government : We are not in government. ?]

[? if psi_majority : The <span style="color: [+ psi_colour +];">**[+ psi_name +]**</span> holds a majority. ?]

[? if liberal_reform_accepted : No land reform. ?]

[? if liberal_crackdown_accepted and liberal_crackdown_complete == 0 : Crackdown on Paramilitaries: [+ liberal_crackdown_timer +] weeks left. ?]

[? if liberal_crackdown_accepted and liberal_crackdown_complete == 1: Crackdown on Paramilitaries: Completed. ?]

[? if liberal_nationalisation_accepted : No nationalisation. ?]

[? if liberal_budget_accepted : No entering deficit spending. ?]

[? if liberal_foreign_accepted : Continuation of our alignment with the <span style="color: #002654;">**Western**</span> <span style="color: #D7141A;">**Allies**</span>. ?]

[? if liberal_aid_accepted : No aid to the <span style="color: #750e0e;">**Soviet Union**</span>. ?]

[? if catholic_papacy_accepted and roman_question_answered == 0 : Roman Question resolved: [+ catholic_papacy_timer +] weeks left ?]

[? if catholic_papacy_accepted and roman_question_answered == 1 : Roman Question resolved: Completed ?]

[? if catholic_education_accepted : Pro-secular education reforms disallowed. ?]

[? if catholic_women_accepted : No women's rights reform. ?]

[? if catholic_charity_accepted : No funding for non-<span style="color: [+ ppi_colour +];">**catholic**</span> charities. ?]

[? if catholic_nationalisation_accepted :  No Anti-<span style="color: [+ ppi_colour +];">**Catholic**</span> nationalisations. ?]

